 "notes": [
  "Cape: glTF cannot carry the cloth's PC2 caches, so the baked cloth of every clip is fitted with 24 cape bones (6 columns round his back x 4 rows, Cape_<row>_<col>, row 0 at the hem, children of mixamorig:Spine2; bilinear weights; the pinned rows under the hood keep their spine weights). Their keys reproduce cape_cache/<clip>.pc2 (errors per clip in clips.<clip>.cape_fit; spine_only_mean_cm is the error of the cape skinned to the spine alone). No new cloth bake. Solidify (1 cm, inwards) is applied.",
  "Spear: the per-clip object actions (<clip>__spear) are baked onto the bone 'SpearBone' (child of mixamorig:RightHand); the spear mesh is skinned to it. In the deaths it leaves the hand at spear_release.",
  "Locomotion is in place. walk and step_lane move the figure by root_vel (m/s, Godot axes); idle, idle_rest and turn_90 stand still (their small source drift was removed by retarget_clips.py). Deaths keep their authored travel on the hips (root_motion true, hips_drift); do not add it again.",
  "turn_90: the turn is moved to the root as in the footman's export: the body stays at idle's heading and root_yaw (degrees per frame from the first frame) turns the figure.",
  "Godot imports every clip with loop mode none; set it from clips.<clip>.loop. Animation names equal the clip names (clips.<clip>.anim)."
 ],
